
      --------------------------------*-------------------------------
                  The BABYLON PROJECT Future System Plans
      ----------------------------------------------------------------

   Planned additions to the system include:

    1. Online doors as they become available
    2. An ISDN line for DIRECT net feeds
    3. A door to allow for DIRECT net access via the ISDN line
    4. Additional nodes as funds become available
    5. Faster modems (probably at the same time the ISDN line goes in)
    6. Open to suggestions..... :)
